            <div xml:id="m-0db2f257-13b2-4c1d-8c7b-268be0da211f">
              <lg xml:id="m-9205a5cc-f9ac-4a4a-9d38-1c2fd7dfcf60">
                <l xml:id="m-5e3d4783-ed47-46a3-b80e-eedac876338a" facs="#m-2d32d3e7-d53f-4187-9753-56547233378e" label="ambiguous">1236</l><l xml:id="m-d58bfb4c-e24c-4b72-b815-b6d71ec3e274" facs="#m-f88d82d7-3011-4b8a-bdfa-ba80dad9d8ca" label="text-like">Common of Holy Women. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-30ca2b0f-6249-4075-b9e4-880514a315f5" facs="#m-f3042af4-ed8b-4d0a-88e9-5f160a9cede4" label="lyrics-like">v. Diffúsa est grátia in lábiis túis. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-1ca68395-aa32-4b84-92dc-a2098b2e35bb" facs="#m-7105b201-f2d8-495c-a5e3-41d93855b6c2" label="lyrics-like">F. Proptérea benedixit te Déus in aetérnum. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-df31cd37-03cc-4e5e-ad90-0169fdbf3008" facs="#m-7726ae42-e583-468b-9b82-8d4cc8c78ba9" label="text-like">At Magn. E</l><l xml:id="m-3e878b86-f32f-4da5-8147-23f264e7e18d" facs="#m-6b515461-dd49-4cad-88a7-10588ec340a5" label="ambiguous">Ant. 5.G —</l><l xml:id="m-34aa7a66-3fcb-4152-aeec-6c71e3a5ad4b" facs="#m-3bf00475-8dcb-40e6-8838-5ceb675bfecf" label="lyrics-like">Anum sú-am “apéru-it ino-pi,</l><l xml:id="m-593d3e45-ae7c-483e-91b9-7a604e1e4c72" facs="#m-3394c24c-55b4-43d0-a71d-aa36610316cb" label="lyrics-like">et pálmas</l><l xml:id="m-cae8ec4d-97c5-4c3b-b61e-38b052f7df51" facs="#m-af781220-8955-49d6-b636-893b699d8ff7" label="lyrics-like">o-ti-ó-sa</l><l xml:id="m-1723bdb5-6d2b-4dc8-b5b5-6a15cc505806" facs="#m-d9ace5ae-8011-4113-92f9-9bdfecea4be5" label="lyrics-like">sú-as exténdit ad páupe-rem: et pá-nem</l><l xml:id="m-f9d67365-ff31-489a-9f25-c2306413c12f" facs="#m-335a9e11-f8af-4eff-839e-b9163b27e675" label="lyrics-like">non comé-dit. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1d4a4998-e70d-4fa7-b8d0-604d71dc7b6c" facs="#m-b9bca245-fe5f-47d9-9060-a1e33a8307c8" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212, or p. 218.</l><l xml:id="m-6b195e3d-6783-483d-8f02-02b6f7e50f9a" facs="#m-b2a46c83-3327-41f9-8d7a-cfefdf5e97ff" label="text-like">For a Holy Woman Martyr. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-491f567d-2882-4927-88e8-8e27adbc8384" facs="#m-e292e891-3985-42de-bf74-969eba58f8cb" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui inter cétera poténtiae beátae N. Mártyris tuae natalitia</l><l xml:id="m-b45256dc-5cc8-4e99-a078-cd573e3f5e7d" facs="#m-a7cf095a-656a-490d-942d-eead7dfd89af" label="lyrics-like">A tuae mirácula, étiam in sexul cólimus,“ per ejus ad te exémpla</l><l xml:id="m-c03620f3-1a0b-483a-adda-c31aa5237919" facs="#m-158ebaad-9187-4501-8aa3-235986ce1068" label="lyrics-like">gradiámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8611cd51-6680-4100-9ae8-99ef9111e2e6" facs="#m-8de5eb2e-d5f7-408e-a4c5-f00d3d3dff91" label="lyrics-like">frágili victóriam martyrii contuli¬</l><l xml:id="m-c28869b9-b936-4cee-bd54-02672d353207" facs="#m-9cc2139f-5651-4d4f-b730-0931d88096d4" label="lyrics-like">concéde propitius; ut qui</l><l xml:id="m-e0460511-84e1-446e-9377-86ab9138a2d2" facs="#m-00549acd-bb9d-41a6-87f0-b371aae95835" label="text-like">For a Holy Woman, not a Martyr. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-06973f82-da4a-426e-a817-0097ea0ea20e" facs="#m-bb11b8e9-d346-44ba-af18-56a9a4324af1" label="lyrics-like">"Xáudi nos Deus salutáris no- devotiónis erudiámur afféctu. Per</l><l xml:id="m-384aa747-84c1-4482-af03-e12cb0d0f1d2" facs="#m-1ecc7821-d53b-4c60-9bea-2ea10bc3f79b" label="lyrics-like">Uster: t ut sicut de beátae N. l Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3208a23a-880f-44a0-9742-c32fe8822018" facs="#m-63a878d5-1b33-46e8-abd9-cbfde46911a9" label="lyrics-like">festivitáte gaudémus;" ta piae!</l><l xml:id="m-33e8ee09-a604-4bf2-b321-663b8a9cfe3b" facs="#m-5be701a1-3324-4a25-830b-bde384780853" label="text-like">VIf a Commemoration is to be made from another Office, which has the same</l><l xml:id="m-e6f6e778-4605-4310-8f46-e543b034ce27" facs="#m-7081ad5d-068f-4a46-b3ce-f58232cddab1" label="text-like">Antiphon as the above, the following Antiphon is said for the Commemoration:</l><l xml:id="m-14780dec-ec13-489c-bfb3-ac1ccd9ca3d5" facs="#m-952abc5a-64c0-4e47-81f8-3ff7b8b908e0" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ddc345c5-0341-45e4-b881-cb5999135912" facs="#m-4d69ca8f-400a-4876-a41b-4b4a17ecd8bd" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-26f84d42-0d70-4eb8-aec2-4b21f3222b3a" facs="#m-c9854279-900d-47e9-aa50-08ed8dba894b" label="lyrics-like">DAte é-i" de frúctu mánu-um su-á-rum, et láudent</l><l xml:id="m-84dd51f9-7091-429a-a62e-e12d28f77adf" facs="#m-cbb4b0a0-712a-4a0f-925c-45f93298928a" label="lyrics-like">é-am in pórtis ópe-ra é-jus. T. P. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f9ea2a69-1794-48ed-a3e4-f67608b241a6" facs="#m-9579fb3a-1290-4968-87b2-0c2cefb1d34f" label="lyrics-like">v. Diffúsa est grátia in lábiis túis (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-aec13e52-429e-4f9f-86b8-ae0dc0c92d98" facs="#m-955ab16a-4dd0-4fc1-a3f0-ba972216fd77" label="lyrics-like">K. Proptérea benedixit te Déus in aetérnum. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-50273af7-e825-4620-a807-1cadf0fe9786" facs="#m-c6ec8517-f262-4812-8d18-35ef2d00f373" label="text-like">If this Y. has already been said, it is here replaced by the followins:</l><l xml:id="m-f6754591-ae76-41d7-b4f2-7f623840d0c2" facs="#m-8a768489-53d1-4c8b-87ec-6a47c7dd3cf1" label="lyrics-like">V. Adjuvábit éam Déus vúltu súo. (T. P. Alleluia.)</l><l xml:id="m-aec496c7-eb62-4f2f-be31-72bdd373261d" facs="#m-0ed593f8-c593-451f-aaea-8bbeaa197e2f" label="ambiguous">"</l><l xml:id="m-39f03e0c-0622-4b01-92c1-4bfdb3da96c6" facs="#m-c997a57d-2100-42c0-8828-44f5847857d2" label="lyrics-like">K. Déus in médio éjus, non commovébitur. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>